## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.12+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
- [just](https://just.systems/)

### Installation

```sh
uv sync --dev
```

### Usage

```sh
# Run the CLI
uv run {{ project_name }} --help

# Run the example command
uv run {{ project_name }} example World
```

## Development

```sh
# Check formatting and linting
just fmt
just lint

# Fix formatting and linting
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Run type checker
just typecheck
```

## Testing

```sh
# Run unit tests
just test-unit

# Run all tests
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate
```

